a's richest man  was arrested in 2003 for tax crimes  after he supported putin's political  rival kordakovsky said the charges were  fabricated and he was pardoned and  released in 2013. the oligarchs learned  their wealth was conditional on  obedience to putin but many of today's  oligarchs are current or former putin  officials as putin has consolidated  power and asserted state control over  more private businesses a new breed of  oligarch emerged the seal of ark  the word combines oligarch and siloviki  russian for the country's military and  security elite many see levars know  putin personally from his time in the  kgb or from working under him in saint  petersburg during his early post-soviet  political career oligarchs face a rocky  future as the west punishes putin's  russia as of march 14th 20 of them are  under personal sanction by the u.s and  its allies it no longer seems to matter  which side russia or ukraine they've  taken oligarchs who've sold their  russian assets and moved their holdings  to the west are hurriedly distancing  themselves from putin and his regime  many of them are being slapped with  sanctions anyway sea levarx and those  with russian assets haven't been  protected by putin and they've seen  their fortunes plummet as russian  markets collapse

